      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Computer Security</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_org">Meta Platforms Inc</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_per">Wang, Alexandr (Technology Executive)</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_per">Zuckerberg, Mark E</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_per">Friedman, Nat (1977- )</category>
      <ns1:content height="1800" medium="image" url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/10/07/multimedia/META-MUSE-1-bwvl/META-MUSE-1-bwvl-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" width="1800" />
      <ns1:credit>Gabriela Bhaskar/The New York Times</ns1:credit>
      <ns1:description>Mark Zuckerberg, Meta’s chief executive, with various iterations of the Muse avatar. </ns1:description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Why My Conversations with OpenAI’s ‘ChatGPT for Teens’ Made Me Very Worried</title>
